        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>4-1/2 x 4 Square Corner Spring Hinge, PBB-SP814540-626 </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged  complete with (1) Single Action Spring Door Hinge, Tension Adjusting Tool, Locking Pins plus #12 x 1-1/4\" Wood  Screws and #12-24 x 1/2\" machine screws.  Utilizes ANSI template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Tension Tool is use to adjust spring tension. The Locking Pins hold the Spring in tension after it is set. These adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply  to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). The internal spring is coated in plastic that helps rust prevention.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications </b> for PBB-SP814540-626 Steel Spring Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel </li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square Corners</li>\r\n<li>Gauge of Metal: .134 (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Number of Holes: 8</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Self Lubricating Bearings </li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Spring Torque</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
